{"name": "Cards & Cannons", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/872d52953c351fee7c9d623699af929c.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/b6bf55d7a62730ca2035d5fcbfe4b52d.poster.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/b6bf55d7a62730ca2035d5fcbfe4b52d.webm?t=1787988978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/b6bf55d7a62730ca2035d5fcbfe4b52d.mp4?t=1787988978\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Cards &amp; Cannons, you build increasingly powerful tower defense realms to churn through unimaginable enemy hordes. Build smart, create choke points and unlock devastating synergies with each more challenging run!<strong> </strong>- You call the shots. Your deck. Your strategy. Your chaos. How far can you push it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gigabrain tactics? Glorious failure? Doesn't matter - run it back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/5a3b47af748f124b13e97b4672991af1.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/482fb806362e650966dcf7297851640a.poster.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/482fb806362e650966dcf7297851640a.webm?t=1787988978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/482fb806362e650966dcf7297851640a.mp4?t=1787988978\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/50e39d1c046b79dfe0516686a01514be.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span><br/>Discover new cards and make your deck of mighty tower defense buildings even more powerful<strong>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/71ee5d58196b26a92474ea06cf7385b6.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span>Build increasingly powerful realms run after run, place your defenses and upgrade them to the max! You alone decide how you protect your castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/9b14d08bc26fc0f92f5563bd1911fdd8.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span>You decide where you place the spawners - one wrong move and you will feel it! Lure the enemies into your deadly traps and snatch their shiny loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/4a36bfb94e283655436726ca94b8ab0f.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span>Summon devastating spells and rain destruction on your enemies! No time to go AFK, jump in and help your towers crush the enemy waves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/cc6f7073066ef111b6d32dee87e5f09b.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span>Stack up powerful abilities, collect game-breaking buffs and discover crazy synergies - from wild lightning storms to... Bananas? Yeah, really!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/311974470442171c2e615be644042534.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span>Battle through different worlds and carve your own path to victory! Each realm brings new enemies, epic duels, and permanent upgrades. Can you become absolutely overpowered and defeat all the bosses?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/fd416b2b67556880ce80cb3da74065a2.poster.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/fd416b2b67556880ce80cb3da74065a2.webm?t=1787988978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/fd416b2b67556880ce80cb3da74065a2.mp4?t=1787988978\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/8e444bce0f674414501477a567f29884.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're Flamehead Games, an indie studio based in Berlin. Cards &amp; Cannons is our debut project, and we hope you have an absolute blast with it!\u00a0We'd love to hear your feedback to make the game even better :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now get in there and don't forget to wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/55aad50191ce16a4d8e12fa96f7a23b3.poster.avif?t=1787988978\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/55aad50191ce16a4d8e12fa96f7a23b3.webm?t=1787988978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/extras/55aad50191ce16a4d8e12fa96f7a23b3.mp4?t=1787988978\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build your own realm and turn every path into a devious trap in this roguelite tower defense deckbuilder! Crush endless enemy hordes with mighty spells and crazy builds in unique runs. Defeat powerful bosses and conquer world after world in this colorful medieval madness!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536920/0ab29e6bb4b104a2138b490d31825f42d1a556c4/header.jpg?t=1787988978", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Turn-Based Strategy", "City Builder", "Card Game", "Roguelite", "Medieval"], "developers": "Flamehead Games", "publishers": "Flamehead Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4536920", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/jeNBmtlsLgs", "first_seen": 1787954400.0, "review_rank": 27}